{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里泛起沉沉的酸楚，越是坦然地喜欢，越在意对方是否也珍惜这份心意。因为他刚把喜欢充分展开，能否得到认真回应已成了切身的期待，而这终究取决于对方。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始感到，自己的深情无法替对方决定如何回应；对方的态度会直接牵动他的欢喜。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文刚把他对被珍惜的期待推得更强，这一解释能将幸福中的苦涩落在回应的不确定性上。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选1\", \"候选11\", \"候选13\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里有股沉重却坚定的认真，连欢喜也带上了分量。因为他已把自己的喜欢看作值得珍惜的心意，坦然表达让这份投入变得更加切身。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始感到，充分展开自己的喜欢，也意味着更深地承受这份投入带来的牵动。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"这一解释把重点放在他对自身心意的郑重上，而非对方是否回应；前文对自己的喜欢已有价值的确认，为这种沉重的坚持提供了依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选8\", \"候选9\", \"候选10\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "386b717f-572e-4e50-9c23-ef199c8a0cb1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T025856907299Z", "elapsed_seconds": 203.453, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:02:20.379031+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a72c64719c3509be6e3cab2f0cc2a2a2734fd2f791cba9b4544cb9087e6b703e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp